151	 *       </ul>
152	 * </ul>
153	 *
154	 * <p>As such, the CycleDetectingLockFactory may not be suitable for performance-critical
155	 * applications which involve tightly-looped or deeply-nested locking algorithms.
156	 *
157	 * @author Darick Tong
158	 * @since 13.0
